 "summary": "Three-terminal linear regulators for a fixed negative rail, delivering up to 100 mA with a built-in current limit and thermal shutdown. Outputs are -5, -8, -12 and -15 V; the AC grade holds ±5 % over 0 to 125 °C junction, the AB grade covers -40 to 125 °C. L79L05ACD13TR is the -5 V AC part in SO-8 on tape and reel.",
