  "notes": [
   "The two digits after L79L give the output voltage: 05, 08, 12 or 15 for -5, -8, -12 or -15 V.",
   "AC parts hold the output to ±5 % and run with the junction at 0 to 125 °C; AB parts cover a junction of -40 to 125 °C. A ±10 % C selection is also named for the family.",
