   "title": "Test circuit",
   "page": 4,
   "description": "The regulator between a negative input and its negative output, with 0.33 µF from VIN to ground and 0.1 µF from VOUT to ground. GND is the common node. Every electrical characteristic is measured with these two capacitors.",
